commit c1c7384e02becc623c6a42985f7178ca98137264
Author: Andrew Scott <atscott@google.com>
Date:   Mon Oct 18 15:19:21 2021 -0600

    Add reusable types for router guards (#54580)

This refactor makes it easier to update the return types of guards.
Rather than having to track what types guards can return, which may
change with new features over time, `MaybeAsync<GuardResult>` can be
used instead.

PR Close #54580ad.

    PR Close #54580

