Author: Jessica Janiuk <jessica.janiuk@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Mar 19 09:50:38 2025 -0400

    fixes timing of hydration cleanup on control flow (#60425)

This properly cleans up stale control flow branches in the case
that branches change between server and client at the same
timing as NgIf / NgSwitch.

fixes: #58670
fixes: #60218

