commit 5ae85e4849b32404d1a29985311fa5134f2c1406
Author: Andrew Scott <atscott@google.com>
Date:   Tue Jan 9 10:24:29 2024 -0800

    node removal notifies scheduler only when animations are enabled (#53857)

Node removal is immediate and does not require change detection to run
when animations are not provided. This refactor makes the animation
engine notify the scheduler rather than doing it on all node removals.

PR Close #53857    
    PR Close #53857

